\name{resources}
\alias{resources}
\title{Return or display resource information used by SelectionTools}

\description{
Return or display resource information used by SelectionTools.
}

\usage{
resources(expr)
}

\arguments{
   \item{expr}{Function argument used by this operation.}
}
\value{
Invisibly returns the value produced by evaluating \code{expr}; its class and structure are therefore exactly those returned by \code{expr}. Resource/timing information is reported as a side effect.
}
